WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.625
Your account's Flows tab lists every Flow, built in Ringg or in WhatsApp Manager

00:00:05.625 --> 00:00:15.824
Open a Flow: its details show a preview you can fill in

00:00:15.824 --> 00:00:20.442
In the WhatsApp assistant, select WhatsApp Flows, then Add flow

00:00:20.442 --> 00:00:22.983
Pick a published Flow

00:00:22.983 --> 00:00:29.542
Write the message and button that carry it

00:00:29.542 --> 00:00:37.903
Say when it's useful. It opens on its first screen

00:00:37.903 --> 00:00:41.033
Click Save

00:00:41.033 --> 00:00:44.305
Tag it in the prompt with @ so the assistant knows when to send it

00:00:44.305 --> 00:00:50.248
To start the chat yourself, put the Flow on a template

00:00:50.248 --> 00:01:05.426
Under Buttons, add a Flow button and pick the Flow

00:01:05.426 --> 00:01:11.020
In Logs, the customer's answers show as Response sent

00:01:11.020 --> 00:01:16.415
Click View response to see every answer, by screen
